{"ID":"20240513083400-2pptohk","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083400-2pptohk","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083400-2pptohk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513110053-u1mk5qk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513110053-u1mk5qk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:840,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513110053-u1mk5qk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:507,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:507\u0026#125;","title":"053","type":"doc","updated":"20240515125726"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513110053-u1mk5qk","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 931px;","id":"20240513110053-u1mk5qk","updated":"20240515125726"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/04/25"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"050-5 H, YT"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"體形中等"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"20080505"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肺癌"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服前方後"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 胃口不好,因吃藥後有噁心"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 大便每日行,比以前多一次"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 小便正常"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 口渴少了"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5. 睡無寒熱"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6. 雙足熱。手溫額熱。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7. 心痛徹背,但痛在背上方整塊痛"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8. 前心口痛到後背整塊"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9. 睡不好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10. 在1:00AM前,5:00AM後睡最好,因不痛而好睡.每次因背痛及頭痛醒來"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11. 右眼視力模糊,右側頭痛"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12. 咳嗽較多,無痰"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"13. 無盜汗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"14. 半夜醒來胸痛,有燥熱"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈沉有力"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黃濕"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"穴同前 加 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"行間 魚際"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" →滎穴,治時症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"左俠溪 右太陽透率谷 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→右側頭痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. HT-32烏金丸 三兩"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 桔梗一兩 炙甘草一兩 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→桔梗甘草湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"射干三錢 紫菀三錢 冬花二錢 杏仁三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" →射干麻黃湯之意"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柴胡三錢 黃芩三錢 玉金五錢 龍膽草三錢 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→清肝"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"補骨脂三錢 澤瀉五錢 茯苓五錢 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→補腎利水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"半夏四錢 生姜二片 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→小半夏湯排水止嘔"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"龍骨三錢 牡蠣五錢 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→鎮驚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"川芎三錢 白芍五錢 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→右側頭痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"枳實三錢 瓜蔞實三錢 薤白三錢 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→胸痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫參五錢 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→肺痛下利"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.胸腔陰陽平衡時,手掌心熱,手背涼.今病人掌心熱延伸至手指背"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→肺縮小"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.治肺必治肝,守住肝則病到此為止,不會再進了"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.肺有問題時,春(金剋木),夏(火剋金)皆不利"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}